1
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:17,500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

2
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:21,380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

3
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:24,420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:29,140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

5
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:33,220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

6
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:37,500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

7
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:40,780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

8
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:49,300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

9
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,380
♪Together, they are known♪

10
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:56,660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

11
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:31,900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

12
00:01:32,060 --> 00:01:34,980
[Episode 11]
[This story is purely fictional]

13
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:14,660
Everyone is here.

14
00:02:15,470 --> 00:02:16,340
Where's Xiangu?

15
00:02:29,710 --> 00:02:30,130
Fifth Master!

16
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:32,290
Master Zhang, he...

17
00:02:33,190 --> 00:02:34,610
Laogou brought Xiangu here.

18
00:02:35,150 --> 00:02:36,010
Let him

19
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:37,780
deal with it.

20
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:42,260
Master Zhang,

21
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,850
do you think Xiangu came down here

22
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,690
for another purpose?

23
00:02:47,590 --> 00:02:48,890
Laogou cares about the greater good.

24
00:02:50,710 --> 00:02:52,410
Now that this involves the Japanese forces,

25
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:55,340
I'm sure he won't prioritize his feelings over the bigger picture.

26
00:02:56,150 --> 00:02:57,060
Our priority now

27
00:02:57,430 --> 00:02:57,980
is this place.

28
00:02:58,960 --> 00:02:59,940
Examine the bodies

29
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:00,940
and identify the cause of death.

30
00:03:01,190 --> 00:03:01,540
Yes.

31
00:03:34,980 --> 00:03:36,660
[Yoshiyuki Hatoyama Identification Document]

32
00:03:37,150 --> 00:03:37,500
Master,

33
00:03:38,190 --> 00:03:38,890
it's Yoshiyuki Hatoyama.

34
00:03:44,710 --> 00:03:46,340
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama died here.

35
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:49,410
Master,

36
00:03:50,870 --> 00:03:52,060
everyone here committed seppuku.

37
00:03:56,870 --> 00:03:59,170
Master Zhang!

38
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,940
Look around. Look.

39
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:04,220
It's not finished yet.

40
00:04:04,910 --> 00:04:05,340
What do you mean?

41
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:08,820
According to the rules in Fengdu,

42
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,170
a tutelary deity shrine

43
00:04:11,020 --> 00:04:13,880
must contain 72 Star Mansions

44
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:16,290
in accordance with

45
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:18,140
its location.

46
00:04:18,630 --> 00:04:19,490
But look.

47
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:21,050
There are only around 10 Star Mansions here.

48
00:04:22,070 --> 00:04:22,810
And this altar

49
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:25,340
is incomplete.

50
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:27,340
No ritual tools

51
00:04:27,870 --> 00:04:28,250
or

52
00:04:29,070 --> 00:04:29,980
offerings.

53
00:04:32,070 --> 00:04:33,050
I think

54
00:04:34,390 --> 00:04:35,930
something must have gone terribly wrong

55
00:04:36,510 --> 00:04:37,660
during construction.

56
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,610
That's why they fled.

57
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:45,370
But why did the Japanese

58
00:04:47,310 --> 00:04:48,810
come to an unfinished

59
00:04:48,830 --> 00:04:49,490
construction site?

60
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,050
And they

61
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:53,020
committed seppuku here.

62
00:04:55,310 --> 00:04:56,610
How weird.

63
00:05:00,630 --> 00:05:02,100
Be vigilant. There might be a trap here.

64
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:03,810
Leave no stones

65
00:05:04,070 --> 00:05:04,730
unturned.

66
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:05,490
Yes.

67
00:05:59,360 --> 00:05:59,780
Xiangu!

68
00:06:00,750 --> 00:06:01,140
Xiangu!

69
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:05,140
Xiangu.

70
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:09,610
Laogou.

71
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,490
What are you doing here?

72
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:14,540
To finish my mission.

73
00:06:15,390 --> 00:06:16,370
Was he already aware that the Japanese

74
00:06:16,430 --> 00:06:17,340
are down here?

75
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:18,780
Is whatever you're doing

76
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,580
related to them?

77
00:06:21,310 --> 00:06:22,050
Are you doubting me?

78
00:06:23,630 --> 00:06:24,290
Just answer me.

79
00:06:25,430 --> 00:06:26,250
What I'm doing here

80
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:27,810
has nothing to do with the Japanese.

81
00:06:30,830 --> 00:06:31,930
What were you thinking, then?

82
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:34,610
Why did you act on your own?

83
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,050
I was so worried.

84
00:06:37,750 --> 00:06:39,100
I promised Ding Qiansui

85
00:06:39,510 --> 00:06:40,490
to explore this place for him.

86
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:41,660
For that, I marked the places I've been to.

87
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:43,980
But soon, I realized

88
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:46,370
my marks appeared in places

89
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:48,340
I've never been to.

90
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:49,900
They are even in my handwriting.

91
00:06:58,060 --> 00:07:00,060
[Hurry Up]

92
00:07:01,310 --> 00:07:01,900
So,

93
00:07:02,310 --> 00:07:04,170
I followed the markings here.

94
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,340
Calm down.

95
00:07:08,750 --> 00:07:09,610
Have you forgotten

96
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:11,700
that this tower almost killed you?

97
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,780
What you saw was an illusion

98
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:15,050
trying to mislead you.

99
00:07:17,310 --> 00:07:17,900
Remember

100
00:07:17,900 --> 00:07:19,300
the hypothesis you told me?

101
00:07:21,270 --> 00:07:22,100
You said this tower

102
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,930
would take away what we cared about the most.

103
00:07:26,070 --> 00:07:27,290
All of you ran into trouble.

104
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:30,220
Zhang Qishan's men vanished.

105
00:07:30,950 --> 00:07:31,340
Your dogs,

106
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:32,340
men,

107
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:34,540
and even I died before your eyes.

108
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:36,660
But I

109
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:40,730
have not encountered anything yet.

110
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:43,930
I was wondering

111
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:46,250
if perhaps there was nothing

112
00:07:46,270 --> 00:07:47,250
I truly cared about.

113
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:51,610
But no, I realized

114
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:55,400
that the tower has played its trick on me.

115
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:58,490
It took away something I care a lot about.

116
00:07:59,630 --> 00:08:00,250
What is it?

117
00:08:01,390 --> 00:08:02,220
I'll retrieve it for you.

118
00:08:04,630 --> 00:08:06,540
No one can retrieve what it took away.

119
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:09,850
It took away my faith.

120
00:08:11,830 --> 00:08:13,700
But I haven't figured everything out yet.

121
00:08:14,510 --> 00:08:15,490
I need time.

122
00:08:19,430 --> 00:08:20,100
It's okay.

123
00:08:21,310 --> 00:08:22,050
I'll keep you company,

124
00:08:22,510 --> 00:08:22,810
okay?

125
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:25,140
Laogou.

126
00:08:26,190 --> 00:08:26,970
Certain things

127
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:28,650
require me to find the answers alone.

128
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:31,730
Master Zhang is waiting for you out there.

129
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:42,180
If this is your decision,

130
00:08:43,510 --> 00:08:44,530
I'll respect it.

131
00:08:46,390 --> 00:08:47,100
But promise me

132
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,370
that whatever you find,

133
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:51,580
you must tell me.

134
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:52,940
Okay?

135
00:08:55,670 --> 00:08:56,130
Okay.

136
00:08:57,030 --> 00:08:57,770
I can tell no one

137
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,370
but you anyway.

138
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:02,940
Okay.

139
00:09:04,550 --> 00:09:05,340
Blow the whistle if anything.

140
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:07,490
I'll be there.

141
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:10,490
Don't worry.

142
00:09:18,270 --> 00:09:18,850
I'll be fine.

143
00:09:50,030 --> 00:09:50,820
Master Zhang.

144
00:09:51,790 --> 00:09:52,490
Fifth Master is back.

145
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:05,220
Fifth Master, you're back.

146
00:10:10,910 --> 00:10:11,580
Where's Xiangu?

147
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:16,890
I see it now.

148
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:17,890
Did you two...

149
00:10:17,910 --> 00:10:18,700
Are you done?

150
00:10:23,630 --> 00:10:24,700
Did you find anything interesting?

151
00:10:28,150 --> 00:10:29,060
I already figured out

152
00:10:29,550 --> 00:10:31,420
why Yoshiyuki Hatoyama came here.

153
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:35,490
After the copper meteor event,

154
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:37,940
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama wrote his report.

155
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:39,820
Inside,

156
00:10:40,630 --> 00:10:42,490
he found a peculiar mural.

157
00:10:43,630 --> 00:10:44,250
The mural

158
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:46,770
mentioned the Yin Changsheng Mausoleum.

159
00:10:47,380 --> 00:10:49,700
[Letter, Beiping Japanese Chamber of Commerce]

160
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:53,100
Through the Japanese Chamber of Commerce,

161
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:54,220
Hatoyama solicited help from Xinyue Restaurant

162
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:56,010
to inspect the mural.

163
00:10:57,080 --> 00:11:00,060
He was told that it was drawn by Qingwuzi.

164
00:11:01,270 --> 00:11:02,490
The mural contained the secret

165
00:11:02,510 --> 00:11:04,100
of the Yin Changsheng Palace under Changsha.

166
00:11:04,910 --> 00:11:05,650
And it mentioned

167
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:07,300
that there was a spell

168
00:11:07,750 --> 00:11:08,890
allowing one to travel back

169
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:10,010
in time.

170
00:11:11,030 --> 00:11:12,340
However, it was difficult to find the entrance,

171
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:14,420
and it warned others

172
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:15,490
not to find it.

173
00:11:15,490 --> 00:11:16,320
[Hatoyama Report]

174
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:17,100
As Qingwuzi's records

175
00:11:17,630 --> 00:11:18,980
regarding the copper meteor proved to be accurate,

176
00:11:20,030 --> 00:11:21,060
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

177
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:22,770
firmly believed in Qingwuzi's mural

178
00:11:23,150 --> 00:11:25,110
and the secret of Yin Changsheng.

179
00:11:26,210 --> 00:11:27,040
He was especially fascinated

180
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:30,210
by the spell that could turn back time.

181
00:11:32,150 --> 00:11:32,700
Therefore,

182
00:11:32,700 --> 00:11:33,840
[Changsha]

183
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:35,010
he enacted

184
00:11:35,510 --> 00:11:36,490
Operation Changsha.

185
00:11:37,980 --> 00:11:40,020
[Operation Changsha, Secret]

186
00:11:40,670 --> 00:11:41,420
That's odd.

187
00:11:42,550 --> 00:11:43,060
Master Zhang,

188
00:11:44,510 --> 00:11:45,980
we found Operation Catch All

189
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:46,610
[Top Secret]
on the Japanese

190
00:11:46,910 --> 00:11:47,730
bodies.

191
00:11:48,630 --> 00:11:49,820
How come it becomes

192
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:50,730
Operation Changsha now?

193
00:11:52,750 --> 00:11:53,370
Both operations

194
00:11:54,750 --> 00:11:55,580
must be connected somehow.

195
00:11:55,980 --> 00:11:58,150
[Hatoyama Report, Addendum]

196
00:11:58,150 --> 00:11:58,770
Hatoyama

197
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:01,940
submitted the addendum of the Hatoyama Report

198
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:04,370
and labelled it as top secret.

199
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:06,540
Then,

200
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:08,530
he launched Operation Copper Meteor

201
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:10,470
while devising

202
00:12:10,790 --> 00:12:11,730
Operation Changsha.

203
00:12:11,730 --> 00:12:13,020
[Hatoyama Report]

204
00:12:14,420 --> 00:12:16,670
[Top Secret]

205
00:12:16,670 --> 00:12:17,370
Spicy?

206
00:12:18,030 --> 00:12:18,770
More, please.

207
00:12:23,700 --> 00:12:25,140
[Operation Copper Meteor]

208
00:12:25,630 --> 00:12:26,890
Hatoyama delegated

209
00:12:27,060 --> 00:12:27,790
[Cox Hendry]

210
00:12:27,790 --> 00:12:29,340
Operation Copper Meteor to Cox Hendry

211
00:12:29,340 --> 00:12:30,000
[Operation Copper Meteor]

212
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:30,420
while he

213
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:32,460
initiated Operation Changsha.

214
00:12:34,050 --> 00:12:34,840
He

215
00:12:35,390 --> 00:12:36,850
began his work in Changsha.

216
00:12:47,790 --> 00:12:48,580
Later,

217
00:12:49,030 --> 00:12:50,420
I busted Operation Copper Meteor.

218
00:12:51,150 --> 00:12:53,220
We began eliminating Japanese spies in Changsha.

219
00:12:54,510 --> 00:12:55,700
Japanese activity became restricted,

220
00:12:56,600 --> 00:12:57,100
and the spies

221
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:58,730
were all killed by the Mystic Nine.

222
00:12:59,750 --> 00:13:02,100
[Xiangchun Gate]
But Hatoyama has entered the tower.

223
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:04,220
He lived in the Otherworld Tower.

224
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:06,530
But he

225
00:13:07,510 --> 00:13:08,890
was stuck here until now.

226
00:13:10,630 --> 00:13:11,490
Two years ago,

227
00:13:12,030 --> 00:13:13,530
Hatoyama contacted Japan

228
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:14,460
one last time.

229
00:13:15,510 --> 00:13:16,700
According to his report,

230
00:13:17,390 --> 00:13:18,650
they have already found what they came to find,

231
00:13:19,510 --> 00:13:21,130
but something terrible happened.

232
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:22,490
Since then,

233
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:24,730
there have been no more updates from Hatoyama

234
00:13:25,390 --> 00:13:26,730
and his three elite squads.

235
00:13:27,550 --> 00:13:28,610
Tell them

236
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:31,820
we found

237
00:13:32,870 --> 00:13:34,250
the place.

238
00:13:36,240 --> 00:13:36,700
But

239
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:44,420
we might no longer be able to get out.

240
00:13:50,500 --> 00:13:53,900
[Household Register, Yoshiyuki Hatoyama, Missing]

241
00:13:55,550 --> 00:13:56,130
Master Zhang,

242
00:13:56,790 --> 00:13:58,130
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

243
00:13:58,960 --> 00:14:00,060
must have failed

244
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:02,490
to find the spell to turn back time.

245
00:14:02,910 --> 00:14:03,940
He couldn't find a way to leave,

246
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:06,300
so he committed seppuku here.

247
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:09,530
He was a valuable scientist.

248
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:12,070
There is no way the Japanese government would give up on him.

249
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:14,940
I think they are still in Changsha.

250
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:17,610
They even found the one who gave him supplies.

251
00:14:18,030 --> 00:14:19,460
The one who gave him supplies?

252
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:21,730
Who could do that?

253
00:14:23,790 --> 00:14:25,980
The Mystic Nine cleared all Japanese spies.

254
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:28,440
So only the Chinese

255
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:31,530
who stay in Changsha can do this.

256
00:14:34,240 --> 00:14:35,120
For example,

257
00:14:35,750 --> 00:14:37,820
an influential Japanese sympathizer.

258
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:41,730
Anything else?

259
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:48,100
The information is in piecemeal fashion.

260
00:14:50,510 --> 00:14:51,580
Most of the pages we read

261
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:53,100
in the journals

262
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,100
have been torn off.

263
00:14:54,670 --> 00:14:55,940
Like the soldiers above,

264
00:14:56,550 --> 00:14:57,650
they destroyed the information

265
00:14:58,030 --> 00:14:59,650
on them before they died.

266
00:15:00,240 --> 00:15:00,770
They only kept

267
00:15:01,270 --> 00:15:02,300
what they allowed others to see.

268
00:15:04,030 --> 00:15:05,180
There must be something here

269
00:15:05,720 --> 00:15:06,940
that they did not want anyone to find out.

270
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,420
That's a given.

271
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:11,730
It must be the ultimate truth.

272
00:15:12,150 --> 00:15:13,220
But didn't you say just now

273
00:15:13,600 --> 00:15:14,610
that they committed seppuku because they failed

274
00:15:14,750 --> 00:15:15,650
to find anything useful?

275
00:15:21,270 --> 00:15:21,940
There is more

276
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:24,370
than meets the eye.

277
00:15:25,670 --> 00:15:26,060
Xiaojin.

278
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:28,730
Go through the journals again,

279
00:15:29,750 --> 00:15:30,610
especially

280
00:15:30,910 --> 00:15:31,940
the entry before the torn pages.

281
00:15:38,550 --> 00:15:39,250
Spell.

282
00:15:42,150 --> 00:15:42,610
Master.

283
00:15:46,150 --> 00:15:48,180
There are many references to spells

284
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:48,940
and ponds.

285
00:15:51,400 --> 00:15:52,140
Ponds?

286
00:16:00,510 --> 00:16:02,010
There are many ponds inside.

287
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:04,580
Did the Japanese mean the ponds inside?

288
00:16:07,390 --> 00:16:08,420
But I've checked inside.

289
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:10,820
It has nothing except for caves.

290
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:14,700
Come.

291
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:16,850
Let's go inside again.

292
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:44,300
The one in this photo

293
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,980
looks like the Otherworld Patriarch.

294
