00:37:18,320 --> 00:37:19,420
to search for Fifth Master.

586
00:37:19,920 --> 00:37:21,790
We will search every corner.

587
00:37:22,800 --> 00:37:23,820
We have also put up the bounty

588
00:37:24,280 --> 00:37:25,260
to mobilize all citizens

589
00:37:25,920 --> 00:37:27,050
to collect information about Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

590
00:37:27,630 --> 00:37:28,860
and the Otherworld Patriarch.

591
00:37:33,230 --> 00:37:34,090
The Otherworld Patriarch

592
00:37:35,150 --> 00:37:36,210
expended a lot back then

593
00:37:37,590 --> 00:37:39,820
to build a tower underneath Changsha.

594
00:37:41,030 --> 00:37:42,170
He must have left some traces behind.

595
00:37:44,190 --> 00:37:45,130
As for Hatoyama,

596
00:37:46,590 --> 00:37:47,860
he must have come up with a thorough plan

597
00:37:49,150 --> 00:37:50,650
before he lured us down there.

598
00:37:53,190 --> 00:37:54,490
A sly fox has many hideouts.

599
00:37:55,230 --> 00:37:56,010
Capturing him

600
00:37:57,280 --> 00:37:58,210
won't be easy.

601
00:37:59,590 --> 00:38:00,300
What should we do now then?

602
00:38:01,000 --> 00:38:02,130
No one knows the underground of Changsha

603
00:38:03,550 --> 00:38:05,170
better than the Mystic Nine does.

604
00:38:11,630 --> 00:38:12,380
Have you

605
00:38:12,920 --> 00:38:13,650
notified all of them?

606
00:38:14,400 --> 00:38:15,090
Yes.

607
00:38:16,070 --> 00:38:16,980
Is Second Master back?

608
00:38:18,000 --> 00:38:18,780
He is in Changsha as we speak.

609
00:38:21,280 --> 00:38:21,980
But...

610
00:38:24,510 --> 00:38:26,340
Ninth Master is still being imprisoned by Huo Wenhai.

611
00:38:27,480 --> 00:38:28,260
He probably can't escape.

612
00:38:29,590 --> 00:38:30,490
If he can't escape,

613
00:38:31,590 --> 00:38:32,490
we'll just have to break in.

614
00:38:36,630 --> 00:38:37,460
Gather the Mystic Nine.

615
00:38:38,230 --> 00:38:40,380
We'll have a meeting at Xie Residence an hour later.

616
00:38:41,070 --> 00:38:41,420
Yes.

617
00:38:42,580 --> 00:38:45,580
[Xie's Residence]

618
00:38:45,580 --> 00:38:48,420
[Confession Letter]

619
00:38:58,320 --> 00:38:59,210
Xie Jiu,

620
00:39:00,030 --> 00:39:01,530
you have no idea

621
00:39:01,550 --> 00:39:03,860
how much I did to cover you.

622
00:39:05,000 --> 00:39:06,570
Colluding with the Japanese is a serious crime.

623
00:39:07,360 --> 00:39:08,610
If I hadn't suppressed the news,

624
00:39:09,000 --> 00:39:09,950
the Ministry of War

625
00:39:09,950 --> 00:39:11,640
would have dug out many ugly things.

626
00:39:12,230 --> 00:39:14,780
Can't you see what I'm doing for you here?

627
00:39:26,880 --> 00:39:27,600
Sign it.

628
00:39:28,110 --> 00:39:29,940
If you can tell me who you helped,

629
00:39:31,480 --> 00:39:32,740
I'll talk to them

630
00:39:33,670 --> 00:39:34,690
so you and your clan will be safe.

631
00:39:35,230 --> 00:39:36,980
I'm a man of my own word.

632
00:39:50,510 --> 00:39:51,170
Xie Jiu.

633
00:40:00,590 --> 00:40:01,610
Listen.

634
00:40:01,630 --> 00:40:03,650
Playing deaf will not make the whole thing go away.

635
00:40:04,280 --> 00:40:06,090
You're pretty much convicted of sedition right now.

636
00:40:07,480 --> 00:40:08,380
Sign it

637
00:40:08,960 --> 00:40:10,530
and you might still have a clan.

638
00:40:10,800 --> 00:40:12,010
If you don't sign it,

639
00:40:13,150 --> 00:40:15,820
I'll make sure you're there to watch your clan fall apart.

640
00:40:20,030 --> 00:40:21,780
Who says you can come in? Bugger off!

641
00:40:25,440 --> 00:40:27,380
Officer Huo, did you wake up on the wrong side of the bed?

642
00:40:29,150 --> 00:40:30,050
You're grumpy.

643
00:40:40,150 --> 00:40:41,260
What are you doing here?

644
00:40:41,630 --> 00:40:42,380
We're having a meeting.

645
00:40:43,150 --> 00:40:43,490
Leave.

646
00:40:49,670 --> 00:40:50,530
Fellow masters,

647
00:40:50,920 --> 00:40:52,570
Xie Residence has been appropriated by the military

648
00:40:52,840 --> 00:40:53,420
for official business.

649
00:40:54,070 --> 00:40:55,980
I ask for your sincere cooperation, instead of

650
00:40:56,230 --> 00:40:57,130
making this tough for me.

651
00:40:57,840 --> 00:40:59,170
Did the Huo Clan change their rules or something?

652
00:40:59,590 --> 00:41:00,900
It's run by a man now?

653
00:41:05,030 --> 00:41:06,740
Officer Huo, pardon us.

654
00:41:07,000 --> 00:41:09,170
You must be here to attend the meeting on behalf of the Huo Clan.

655
00:41:10,480 --> 00:41:12,490
But the ancestral rule in the Huo Clan dictates

656
00:41:13,360 --> 00:41:14,610
that only women can run the clan.

657
00:41:18,400 --> 00:41:19,650
Have you...

658
00:41:19,760 --> 00:41:20,490
Insolence!

659
00:41:21,840 --> 00:41:22,780
Xie Jiu colludes with the Japanese.

660
00:41:23,110 --> 00:41:24,010
The military is investigating it.

661
00:41:24,510 --> 00:41:25,740
You're trespassing.

662
00:41:25,760 --> 00:41:26,740
Is this a rebellion?

663
00:41:27,070 --> 00:41:28,490
Guards, arrest them!

664
00:41:35,440 --> 00:41:36,010
Guards!

665
00:41:51,760 --> 00:41:52,900
So much talking.

666
00:41:53,630 --> 00:41:54,210
How noisy.

667
00:41:56,150 --> 00:41:57,130
Aren't we here for a meeting?

668
00:41:57,760 --> 00:41:58,530
Where's Zhang Qishan?

669
00:42:05,280 --> 00:42:05,690
Master Zhang.

670
00:42:25,670 --> 00:42:27,300
Everyone, please take a seat.

671
00:42:44,500 --> 00:42:48,660
♪The past fades like smoke♪

672
00:42:49,020 --> 00:42:51,740
♪A choice is made in silence♪

673
00:42:52,020 --> 00:42:54,820
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

674
00:42:55,220 --> 00:42:58,980
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

675
00:42:59,220 --> 00:43:02,660
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

676
00:43:02,940 --> 00:43:06,340
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

677
00:43:06,420 --> 00:43:13,700
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

678
00:43:14,140 --> 00:43:17,420
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

679
00:43:17,700 --> 00:43:20,940
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

680
00:43:21,100 --> 00:43:25,140
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

681
00:43:25,340 --> 00:43:28,700
♪Who believes in fate?♪

682
00:43:28,940 --> 00:43:32,300
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

683
00:43:32,540 --> 00:43:35,820
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

684
00:43:36,140 --> 00:43:39,820
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

685
00:43:40,020 --> 00:43:43,260
♪Take care♪

686
00:43:43,260 --> 00:43:45,820
♪We once raced♪

687
00:43:45,900 --> 00:43:47,820
♪For the dawn♪

688
00:43:47,980 --> 00:43:51,260
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

689
00:43:51,380 --> 00:43:54,660
♪In the web of fate♪

690
00:43:54,660 --> 00:43:57,860
♪No one can escape♪

691
00:43:58,860 --> 00:44:00,700
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

692
00:44:00,860 --> 00:44:02,420
♪We too were young once♪

693
00:44:02,500 --> 00:44:05,940
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

694
00:44:06,140 --> 00:44:08,460
♪Keep the ember lit♪

695
00:44:08,580 --> 00:44:13,100
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

696
00:44:13,220 --> 00:44:16,180
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

697
00:44:16,420 --> 00:44:19,940
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

698
00:44:20,060 --> 00:44:23,820
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

699
00:44:24,140 --> 00:44:27,620
♪Who believes in fate?♪

700
00:44:27,780 --> 00:44:30,780
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

701
00:44:31,020 --> 00:44:34,780
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

702
00:44:34,940 --> 00:44:38,660
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

703
00:44:38,780 --> 00:44:50,220
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
